WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.679 --> 00:00:06.004
Tap a counter in the palette to put it on the board.

2
00:00:06.004 --> 00:00:08.801
Drag it into the ten-frame. It drops into a cell.

3
00:00:08.801 --> 00:00:15.644
Today’s task: show 7 as a full row of 5 plus 2.

4
00:00:15.644 --> 00:00:20.986
Hold a counter and pick Flip. Red is −1.

5
00:00:20.986 --> 00:00:24.139
A yellow and a red make a zero pair. Flip it back.

6
00:00:24.139 --> 00:00:26.938
Drag across the board to select several counters.

7
00:00:26.938 --> 00:00:31.659
Delete takes them all away. Undo brings them back.

8
00:00:31.659 --> 00:00:34.314
Turn Totals off so the class counts for themselves.

9
00:00:34.314 --> 00:00:41.363
Every task has its prompt and a teacher note, below the board.
